  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solar PV Plus Storage Plant at Nacala Airport, through HDR, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study to assess the technical, financial, and economic viability of a solar photovoltaic (PV) plant of up to 100 megawatts (MW), to be developed in increments of 20-40 MW, and an associated energy storage facility of up to 50 MW of capacity to be located on the property of the Nacala International Airport in Nampula Province in northeastern Mozambique. This will be Mozambique&apos;s second utility-scale solar power plant and its first at an airport.</narrative>
  </description>
